    "## Example Workthrough\n",
    "\n",
    "Suppose:\n",
    "\n",
    "* Input image: ($32 \\times 32 \\times 3$)\n",
    "* Growth rate (k = 4)\n",
    "\n",
    "### Initial Convolution\n",
    "\n",
