    "## Cat vs Dog Classifier\n",
    "\n",
    "Suppose we want to classify images of:\n",
    "\n",
    "* Cats\n",
    "* Dogs\n",
    "* Horses\n",
    "\n",
    "### Input Image\n",
    "\n",
    "Input:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$224 × 224 × 3$$\n",
    "\n",
    "RGB image\n",
    "\n",
    "Example:\n",
    "\n",
    "* picture of a dog\n",
    "\n",
    "### Feature Extraction\n",
    "\n",
    "EfficientNet extracts features like:\n",
    "\n",
    "Early layers:\n",
    "\n",
    "* edges\n",
    "* textures\n",
    "\n",
    "Middle layers:\n",
    "\n",
    "* ears\n",
    "* eyes\n",
    "* fur patterns\n",
    "\n",
    "Deep layers:\n",
    "\n",
    "* complete animal shapes\n",
    "\n",
    "### Classification Layer\n",
    "\n",
    "Final softmax output:\n",
    "$$\n",
    "P(y_i)=\\frac{e^{z_i}}{\\sum_j e^{z_j}}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "Example probabilities:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Class | Probability |\n",
    "| ----- | ----------: |\n",
    "| Cat   |        0.05 |\n",
    "| Dog   |        0.92 |\n",
    "| Horse |        0.03 |\n",
    "\n",
    "Prediction: `Dog`\n",
    "\n",
    "## Charecterstics\n",
